• Bíró's design used a rotating ball to regulate ink flow evenly.$q$, $q$The student wants to explain what made Bíró's design more reliable than earlier attempts. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?$q$, $q$["Bíró's 1938 design used a rotating ball to regulate ink flow evenly, solving the leaking and clogging that plagued earlier ballpoint pens.","László Bíró patented his ballpoint pen design in 1938.","Earlier ballpoint pen attempts often leaked or clogged.","Writing instruments have changed considerably over the centuries."]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Only the correct answer explains the specific mechanism, the rotating ball regulating ink flow, that solved earlier pens' problems.$q$, null),
  ($q$ei-210$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
• The Black Death killed an estimated one-third of Europe's population between 1347 and 1351.
• The resulting labor shortage gave surviving peasants more bargaining power over wages.
• Some historians argue this shift contributed to the eventual decline of the feudal system.$q$, $q$The student wants to explain how the plague's death toll led to changes in peasants' economic position. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?$q$, $q$["Because the Black Death wiped out roughly a third of Europe's population, the resulting labor shortage gave surviving peasants new bargaining power over their wages.","The Black Death killed an estimated one-third of Europe's population.","Some historians link the Black Death to the eventual decline of feudalism.","The Black Death spread across Europe between 1347 and 1351."]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Only the correct answer connects the population loss to the labor shortage and the resulting wage leverage, directly explaining the economic shift.$q$, null),
  ($q$ei-211$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 1, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
