  ($q$ei-212$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
• Scientists first identified a severe seasonal thinning of ozone over Antarctica in 1985.
