• Silk is produced in glands.$q$, $q$The student wants to explain what spiders' webs are for. Which choice most effectively does this?$q$, $q$["Insects can fly.","Silk is made in glands.","Spiders have eight legs.","Spiders spin webs of silk to catch insects."]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$The choice states the purpose.$q$, null),
  ($q$ei-641$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
• The ancient Romans built roads across their empire.
